accessWidener	v1	official

# LiquidBounce's own access widener does NOT propagate to add-ons - every entry there is a plain
# `accessible`/`mutable`, not `transitive-`. Widen anything you need yourself, here.

# Read by TriggerBotPlus: vanilla ignores clicks for a few ticks after a missed swing, and a click
# queued inside that window would be swallowed (the real hit would then arrive a tick too late).
accessible field net/minecraft/client/Minecraft missTime I

# Read by TriggerBotPlus (PrePress = Key): `KeyMapping.click` needs the bound key, which is exposed
# to LiquidBounce by this very same entry in its own access widener.
accessible field net/minecraft/client/KeyMapping key Lcom/mojang/blaze3d/platform/InputConstants$Key;
